**Read:** [Modules in Mechanics of Materials — David Roylance](../../mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design/sources/Mechanics-of-Materials-Roylance.lingua#r_7K2RYA9504FGFGJTVWHMWXD5WY), Statistics of Fracture and Laminated Composite Plates in full; [Applied Mechanics of Solids — Allan F. Bower](../../mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design/sources/Applied-Mechanics-of-Solids-Bower.lingua#r_109WFZBWMEMGHV9TGFD22H2F1W), chapter 9; [Material families and mechanical response — Cambridge DoITPoMS](../sources/Material-Families-and-Mechanical-Response-DoITPoMS.lingua#r_79PNN694CQ82ENKZC6STQJ5KN9), Brittle Fracture and Toughening; [Materials structure and observation — Cambridge DoITPoMS](../sources/Materials-Structure-and-Observation-DoITPoMS.lingua#r_57315283EDNWKYC1PQE23G2AKF), Fibre Composites; [Breviary Technical Ceramics — Verband der Keramischen Industrie](../sources/Breviary-Technical-Ceramics.lingua#r_7998JE61RKQF7VXXYK197KRBH4), material, property and quality sections. Add complete primary studies of one ceramic or glass and one composite.

Develop a flaw-sensitive account and an architecture-sensitive account. Derive the weakest-link size/stress relationship from survival assumptions, and derive a laminate response from ply laws and balances. Keep initiation, stable damage, crack resistance and final failure distinct. Examine specimen preparation, residual stress and evidence for the proposed mechanism.

**Produce:** A reproducible calculation of a nonuniform-stress survival comparison with parameter uncertainty; a laminate A,B,D derivation and independently checked balance/energy results; and a comparison with original experimental observations. Criticize a scalar failure criterion using mechanism evidence. Show how one new observation changes a design interpretation, and identify the untested scale or environment where the conclusion may fail.

**Return:** [Materials engineering — structure, processing and useful behavior](../Materials-engineering.lingua#r_05BF5JM8141RKF1VT5998YFZQ9).
**Continue in materials engineering:** [Defend the material-family and mechanical-response account](Defend-the-material-family-and-mechanical-response-account.lingua#r_1SG5WSPXBJNEJ95BJ5ZB8NZ2D9).

